{{ template "two-thirds-open" . }}
        <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">{{ .Heading }}</h1>
        <p class="govuk-body">This Go example shows how to build a GOV.UK service where the Go server generates every page. It is not a real licensing service.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">Component HTML comes from GOV.UK Frontend {{ .FrontendVersion }}, and tests compare it with every official fixture in that release.</p>
        <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">In this example</h2>
        <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
          <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/">Start page</a></li>
          <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/task-list">Task list</a></li>
          <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/fees">Licence fees</a></li>
          <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/help">Help</a></li>
          <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/guidance">Guidance</a></li>
{{- if .DemosEnabled }}
          <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/components">Component catalogue</a></li>
          <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/examples">Example pages</a></li>
{{- end }}
        </ul>
{{- template "columns-close" . }}
